1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,470
Why did Harrison sell his house so quickly?
哈里森为什么这么快就卖掉房子？

2
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:19,380
Why did Harrison sell his house so quickly?
哈里森为什么这么快就卖掉房子？

3
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:31,110
My old friend, Harrison, had lived in the Mediterranean for many years before he returned to England.
我的老朋友哈里森回到英国以前，在地中海地区住了很多年。

4
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:39,110
He had often dreamed of retiring in England and had planned to settle down in the country.
他常梦想在英国退休，并打算在乡间定居。

5
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:46,320
He had no sooner returned than he bought a house and went to live there.
他一回来就买了一幢房子住了进去。

6
00:00:47,630 --> 00:00:51,880
Almost immediately he began to complain about the weather,
几乎立刻他就开始抱怨天气，

7
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:54,900
for even though it was still summer,
因为即使那时还是夏天，

8
00:00:55,380 --> 00:01:00,600
it rained continually and it was often bitterly cold.
天却下个不停，而且常常冷得厉害。

9
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:06,770
After so many years of sunshine, Harrison got a shock.
在阳光充足的地方住了那么多年，哈里森大吃一惊。

10
00:01:06,790 --> 00:01:11,120
He acted as if he had never lived in England before.
他的举动就好像他从未在英国住过一样。

11
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:15,510
In the end, it was more than he could bear.
最后，他再也无法忍受。

12
00:01:16,780 --> 00:01:22,310
He had hardly had time to settle down when he sold the house and left the country.
他还没来得及安顿下来就卖掉房子，离开了这个国家。

13
00:01:23,510 --> 00:01:27,460
The dream he had had for so many years ended there.
他多年的梦想就此结束。

14
00:01:28,510 --> 00:01:32,200
Harrison had thought of everything except the weather.
哈里森什么都想到了，就是没想到天气。
